### --------------------------------------------------------
### Apps Endpoints (Operator — Tier 2)
### Requires: X-Security, X-App-Name (admin), X-Operator-Key
### --------------------------------------------------------

### List all apps
GET {{$dotenv HOST}}/apps
X-Security: {{$dotenv SECURITY_KEY}}
X-App-Name: {{$dotenv ADMIN_APP_NAME}}
X-Operator-Key: {{$dotenv OPERATOR_KEY}}

### Create a new app
POST {{$dotenv HOST}}/apps
Content-Type: application/json
X-Security: {{$dotenv SECURITY_KEY}}
X-App-Name: {{$dotenv ADMIN_APP_NAME}}
X-Operator-Key: {{$dotenv OPERATOR_KEY}}

{
  "name": "new-app"
}

### Create duplicate app (should return 409 Conflict)
POST {{$dotenv HOST}}/apps
Content-Type: application/json
X-Security: {{$dotenv SECURITY_KEY}}
X-App-Name: {{$dotenv ADMIN_APP_NAME}}
X-Operator-Key: {{$dotenv OPERATOR_KEY}}

{
  "name": "new-app"
}
